This license covers the tooling in this repository only: the launcher, the
build-time patch scripts, the preflight checks, the benchmark and A/B harness,
and the tests.

It does not cover, and does not relicense:

- The model weights (`LibertAIDAI/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-REAP-256E`, and the base
  `deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash`), which are distributed under their own MIT
  license by their publishers.
- vLLM and FlashInfer, which this kit patches at build time and which are
  licensed under Apache-2.0 by their respective projects.
- The base container image `vllm/vllm-openai:deepseekv41-flash-0909`, which is
  redistributed by the vLLM project under Apache-2.0.

